<title>USA: ARV Assisted says fund units tendered.</title>
<headline>ARV Assisted says fund units tendered.</headline>
<dateline>COSTA MESA, Calif. 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ARV Assisted Living Inc said Monday it had been advised by its depository that based on a preliminary count, 375,947.50 units of limited partnership interests in Senior Income Fund L.P. were tendered and not withdrawn in response to the tender offer by a wholly-owned subsidiary of ARV.</p>
<p>ARV said the tender offer expired December 13.</p>
